  <section name="Release Integrity">
    <p>You <strong>must</strong> verify the integrity of the downloaded files.  We provide
    <code>PGP</code> signatures for every release file.  This signature should be matched
    against the <a href="http://www.apache.org/dist/tomcat/tomcat-5/KEYS">KEYS</a> file which contains
    the PGP keys of Tomcat's Release Managers.  We also provide an <code>MD5</code> checksum
    for every release file.  After you download the file, you should calculate a checksum
    for your download, and make sure it is the same as ours.
    </p>
  </section>

